  "description": "Gi-ryeo has a secret: he's really an alien from another world! As High Wizard of the planet Alpha Uri, Gi-ryeo slaved away day in and day out working his soul crushing job. But, after perfecting his transmigration magic, Gi-ryeo escapes into the body of a starved Hunter on Earth. On a new planet, surrounded by more magic than he's ever known, can Gi-ryeo adapt and keep his identity hidden from those seeking the High Wizard? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
